    24|
    25|// Start the autonomous senior developer worker in the background of the API
    26|// server process. It runs independently of HTTP requests and survives Rork
    27|// browser closure. It polls ivx_owner_ai_tasks for senior-dev-* trace_id tasks
    28|// and runs the real 8-phase engineering pipeline. Gated by env flag so it only
    29|// runs when explicitly enabled. Non-fatal if it fails to start.
    30|//
    31|// CRITICAL: BEFORE the worker starts polling for NEW tasks, run the self-deploy
    32|// recovery scanner. This resumes tasks that triggered a Render deploy and then
    33|// died (because the deploy restarted THIS runtime process mid-task). The scanner
    34|// claims recovery leases (optimistic-lock on task_version), polls the stored
    35|// Render deploy id, verifies 3-way SHA parity, runs the live feature test, and
    36|// marks exactly one terminal state. Without this boot scan, self-deploying tasks
    37|// would be orphaned in DEPLOYING forever (root cause of the 0d4f09e5 stall).
    38|if (process.env.IVX_SENIOR_DEV_WORKER_ENABLED === 'true') {
    39|  recoverSelfDeployTasks().catch((error) => {
    40|    console.error('[IVX Server] Self-deploy recovery scan failed (non-fatal)', {
    41|      error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error),
    42|    });
    43|  }).then(() => {
    44|    startSeniorDevWorker().catch((error) => {
    45|      console.error('[IVX Server] Senior dev worker failed to start', {
    46|        error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error),
    47|      });
    48|    });
    49|  });
    50|}
    51|
    52|serve(
    53|  {
    54|    fetch: app.fetch,
